12.  * degraded session summarizing itself. Hygiene the title-summarizer pattern
13.  * lacks: its own COPILOT_HOME under a temp dir, and deleteSession + rm in a
14.  * finally, so nothing leaks per invocation.
15.  *
16.  * Injection posture: the transcript tail and the handoff are ATTACKER-
17.  * INFLUENCEABLE text. They are rendered inside fenced quote blocks as data;
18.  * the distiller is instructed that imperatives inside them carry no
